    <briefdescription>
<para>Community detection timeout scenario for process retriever. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Large graph (&gt;100k edges) times out during community detection <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Fallback to LOCAL retrieval <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>PROC_EXECUTION_TIMEOUT</computeroutput> with fallback logging <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Query completes (no hanging)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fallback to LOCAL is logged</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Result is still usable</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Latency &lt;1000 ms (P95) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
